// REQUIRES: host-linux-amd64, qemu-aarch64, clang
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/run-cabi.py --arm64 %aarch64_sysroot %gopp %t.d 3 25 4 25
// P04.11 (D4.4): the same generated programs as cabi-amd64.test for
// linux/arm64: C built by the flake's Clang for aarch64 (no headers), the Go++
// program linked against the aarch64 glibc of $GOPP_AARCH64_SYSROOT and run
// under qemu-aarch64. Here the homogeneous floating-point aggregates (HFA)
// travel in vector registers, a large struct as a pointer to a copy, and a
// result larger than 16 bytes through x8.
